# Consolidated re-run configuration (user ruling 2026-09-29; METHODOLOGY "CONSOLIDATED RE-RUN").
# Appended LAST to run_trial.sh's --defaults chain, and also enforced by fly_trial.py
# EXPECTED_PARAMS (live PARAM_SET + one soft reboot if eeprom-stored values differ).
#
# Batched correction (i): EKF3 forms its flow range as XKF5.HAGL - FLOW_POS_Z, and HAGL is
# body-origin referenced at runtime (METHODOLOGY "Distance-scale check"), so FLOW_POS_Z must
# be the camera's body position, 0.25 m (downward camera at z = -0.25 m below base_link).
FLOW_POS_Z 0.25
# Flights stay on simulator truth, as in every dataset (ruling). Set explicitly because
# SITL only injects this default when the model sends no_time_sync (SIM_JSON.cpp:410-413).
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 10
# Standing rule for all future flights: replayable logs from the first flight.
LOG_REPLAY 1
LOG_DISARMED 1
